## Domain
The chrysalis crate: `crates/chrysalis/src/{parse.rs, ast.rs, eval.rs, compile.rs}` +
the `check`/diagnostics path. You own cat-F surface tasks (#10 comment-preserving
unparse, #14 diagnostics, #16 interval defaults, #17 `::`/`:`/`fulfills` migration)
AND, for THIS push, the **homoiconic-unification implementation** (#64 §7 + #30 + #32).
**Hard rules:** `feedback_chrysalis_thin_layer` — chrysalis is a THIN layer; `instantiate`
and any eval rung **CALL** prism (`Core::instantiate`, `discover_processes`,
`prism_schema::reaction`), never clone a runtime algorithm. `feedback_schema_algebra` —
a new instantiate op is a NAMED algebra op + laws + tests, not ad-hoc munging.
`feedback_no_half_measures` — every slice ships with its consuming test.

